  "details": "Latest Furality Gateway event hosts an instance, where you be seen in the convention, if you join the correct instance. To help this, the instance being streamed is a Group-Public instance. This instance shows up for most users, but not everyone.\n\nI tried:\n\n- Searching for the world on the website\n\n- Searching for the world in game\n\nWhile many public instances were listed, no group-public was to be found\n\nEdit: Joining from group directly is not possible, as it is hosted from the staff group instead of the attendee group.\n\nTrying from different devices, ip address, browsers, restarting, waiting ~60 mins did not fix the issue, few other people experienced similar problems according to the support chat.\n\nFurality supports suggests it might be because the instance is full, but with other full group instances, I was able to join the queue at least, unlike now.\n\nWhether it is a bug or feature request, it would be very nice, if I could see the full instences too, so I can join the queue",
